  "id": "chicken-quarters-with-wild-rice-and-broccoli",
  "name": "Chicken Quarters with Wild Rice and Broccoli",
  "subtitle": "A creamy baked chicken dinner with rice and vegetables",
  "description": "Chicken leg quarters are baked with a creamy wild-rice mixture, broccoli, and garlic for a straightforward family dinner.",
